{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794535568216,"sessionID":"ses_e2d59c360ffeZZjXvmuyO2sn3H","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2a7b0ee001WEqeD33Lp4R41a","sessionID":"ses_e2d59c360ffeZZjXvmuyO2sn3H","messageID":"msg_1d2a76089001KrPSdx5plCFv0G","type":"tool","id":"call_09991c6c3ef249ba9b30b17e","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"five read-only|Leg advisor|doctor-setup\\.yaml","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor","limit":40},"output":"Found 10 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:\n  Line 378:     yaml: doctor-setup.yaml\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md:\n  Line 25: | Workflow | `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml` |\n\n  Line 45: | `setup` | `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml` |\n\n  Line 49: 3. Load `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml` and execute it step by step.\n\n  Line 62: It then runs five read-only legs once: the sk-code setup battery, the sk-git setup battery, the trigger index freshness check, the runtime mirror check and the advisor status probe with `--warm-only`.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt:\n  Line 19: | `/doctor:setup` | This overview: the doctor target list and the five read-only setup legs |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml:\n  Line 5: purpose: List every doctor target with what it checks, run five read-only legs, and name the runnable doctor command that repairs each failing leg\n\n  Line 6: action: Print the doctor target list -> run the five read-only legs once -> render the per-leg verdict and repair lines through the presentation contract\n\n  Line 57:   